    {
      "v": 6,
      "zh": "以色列人又行耶和华眼中看为恶的事，去事奉诸巴力和亚斯她录，并亚兰的神、西顿的神、摩押的神、亚扪人的神、非利士人的神，离弃耶和华，不事奉他。",
      "en": "The Israelites again did evil in the Lord’s sight.[NOTE:1] They worshiped[NOTE:2] the Baals and the Ashtoreths,[NOTE:3] as well as the gods of Syria, Sidon,[NOTE:4] Moab, the Ammonites, and the Philistines.[NOTE:5] They abandoned the Lord and did not worship[NOTE:6] him.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “in the eyes of the Lord.”",
        "Or “served;” or “followed.”",
        "The Ashtoreths were local manifestations of the goddess Astarte.",
